; String lights, per the reference: run round the window casing and bordered along
; the poster rather than hung as swags. Generated by StringLights from a polyline,
; because the one usable CC0/CC-BY strand on Sketchfab is modelled dead straight
; and cannot be run round a frame.
;
; Bulbs are emissive, not lights — the Environment's glow makes them bloom, and
; ~87 OmniLights would be unthinkable on the mobile backend. Each strand carries
; one dim unshadowed Omni for the wall wash instead. Two draw calls per strand.
;
; The window frame's bottom run sits at y 0.80, just above the sill and the desk
; top at 0.75: at the casing's own 0.78 the bulbs would have grown out of the desk.
