; --- PC tower ----------------------------------------------------------------
; A RetroSystem running ScummVM, standing in the desk's knee hole. systemid
; "scummvm" is registered in MediaDimensions as a 12 cm disc system, so the spawn
; menu hands out a disc for it and RetroSystem takes the tray path; pc_tower.tscn
; then SLIDES that tray rather than hinging a lid, which is what a PC CD-ROM does.
;
; Sited so the bay clears the desk. The tower front is at z -1.58 and the desk
; front at -1.47, so the 0.135 m tray travel brings the tray 0.025 m past the desk
; edge — it emerges into the room instead of grinding into the underside.
